sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    Analyst->>Cockpit: Click "Reconstruct Attack Graph"
    Cockpit->>FastAPI: POST /api/analyze
    FastAPI->>Ingestor: normalize_logs(raw_logs)
    Ingestor-->>FastAPI: Sorted Normalized Logs
    FastAPI->>GraphEngine: build_attack_graph(normalized_logs)
    GraphEngine-->>FastAPI: Cytoscape Nodes, Edges, RCA, Blast Radius
    FastAPI->>Reporter: generate_json_report()
    Reporter-->>FastAPI: Structured XAI Narrative
    FastAPI-->>Cockpit: 200 OK
    Cockpit->>Cytoscape: renderGraph(data)
    Cockpit->>Analyst: Interactive Attack Graph & XAI Narrative
